OL,3,C'We need to know he's safe': Mum's
OL,4,Cplea 10 years on since son's
OL,5,Cdisappearance
OL,7,FA mother who believes "in her heart"
OL,8,Fthat her son is still alive a decade
OL,9,Fafter he vanished has issued a fresh
OL,10,Fappeal for information.
OL,12,FTracey Graham says time stopped for
OL,13,Fher family when Shane disappeared,
OL,14,Fwith the family living through an
OL,15,F"agonising nightmare" ever since.
OL,17,FShe says the worst part of the ordeal
OL,18,Fis the silence and not knowing whether
OL,19,Fher 26-year-old son is safe.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
