OL,3,C'We need to know he's safe': Mum's
OL,4,Cplea 10 years on since son's
OL,5,Cdisappearance
OL,7,FShane Graham was a landscape gardener
OL,8,Fworking for an artificial grass
OL,9,Fcompany and living in St Annes,
OL,10,FLancashire, with his girlfriend at the
OL,11,Ftime of his disappearance.
OL,13,FShane had been working at a house on
OL,14,FAnsdell Road, close to Fairhaven Lake,
OL,15,Fon 29 April 2016.
OL,17,FHe was last seen shortly after leaving
OL,18,Fthe property, walking down Eddington
OL,19,FRoad - just seven streets away -
OL,20,Ftowards the Inner Promenade and the
OL,21,Flake.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786373301
OL,3,C'We need to know he's safe': Mum's
OL,4,Cplea 10 years on since son's
OL,5,Cdisappearance
OL,7,FAround #300 in rent money was left
OL,8,Finside his flat, alongside his wallet.
OL,10,FLancashire Police launched extensive
OL,11,Fenquiries following his disappearance,
OL,12,Fbut officers were unable to find him.
OL,14,FTracey, alongside her husband Ron and
OL,15,FShane's sister Carissa, who are all
OL,16,Foriginally from Torbay in Devon, say
OL,17,Fhope is all they have left.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
