PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786373301
OL,3,C'We need to know he's safe': Mum's
OL,4,Cplea 10 years on since son's
OL,5,Cdisappearance
OL,7,FSpeaking on the impact of the last
OL,8,Fdecade, the 64-year-old mum told the
OL,9,FLDRS: "It's hard to properly explain
OL,10,Fhow this has affected us over last 10
OL,11,Fyears ` we've all turned lunatic in
OL,12,Four own ways.
OL,14,F"As a mother, I yearn and pine to know
OL,15,Fhe's OK, every single day, all of the
OL,16,Fyears since he went missing. If I knew
OL,17,Fsomething had happened to him and I
OL,18,Fwould never see him again, I couldn't
OL,19,Fdeal with the grief.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786373301
OL,3,C'We need to know he's safe': Mum's
OL,4,Cplea 10 years on since son's
OL,5,Cdisappearance
OL,7,F"In my heart, I feel certain he is out
OL,8,Fthere somewhere. I feel like he has
OL,9,Fhad something he is worried about and
OL,10,Fhe couldn't bring himself to tell us,
OL,11,Fand somehow it has escalated.
OL,13,F"If he thinks he has done something
OL,14,Fwrong, he doesn't need to explain
OL,15,Fanything at all. We just need to know
OL,16,Fhe is safe ` if he has chosen his own
OL,17,Fpath, that is OK."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
