FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786373301
OL,3,C'We need to know he's safe': Mum's
OL,4,Cplea 10 years on since son's
OL,5,Cdisappearance
OL,7,FTracey maintains she will never give
OL,8,Fup and lives in hope that Shane will
OL,9,Freach out, even if it is by contacting
OL,10,Fthe police.
OL,12,FIn a direct appeal to her son, she
OL,13,Fadded: "Shane, if you see this, please
OL,14,Flet us know you are OK."
OL,16,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,17,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,18,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,19,Four region.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
